@startuml
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
autonumber
title Diagrama Cierre 4: POST /api/v1/logistics/closings/collections/:transportOrderId (Registro de Liquidación y Arqueo de Caja)

actor "Cajera Central / Liquidador y Chofer" as User
participant "App Web / Móvil" as App
participant "Gateway Controller" as Gateway
participant "Collection Closing Service" as Service
participant "Transaction Manager\n(QueryRunner)" as TX
participant "transport_orders DB" as OrdersDB
participant "collection_closings DB\n(transport_order_collection_closings)" as CollClosingDB
participant "payment_references DB\n(delivery_payment_references)" as PaymentsDB
participant "order_histories DB\n(transport_order_histories)" as HistoryDB

User -> App: Realiza arqueo físico de efectivo, valida transferencias/QR/créditos y plasma firmas
App -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/logistics/closings/collections/525420010\n(CollectionClosingPayloadDto)
Gateway -> Service: registerCollectionClosing(transportOrderId: 525420010, payload, executorId)

Service -> OrdersDB: 1. findOrderById(525420010)
OrdersDB --> Service: order (status: 'WAREHOUSE_CLOSED' o 'IN_LIQUIDATION')

Service -> Service: 2. validateCashierParityBalance(payload)
note right of Service
  Validación Matemática en Memoria:
  - (efectivo + transferencias + QR + cheques) + créditos + cobrador
    == total_invoiced_amount (19088.10 Bs)
  - Diferencia = Bs 0.00 (Cuadre Exacto)
end note

Service -> TX: 3. startTransaction()
activate TX

Service -> CollClosingDB: 4. upsertCollectionClosing(payloadData)
note right of CollClosingDB
  Registra liquidación financiera de caja:
  - cash_amount, transfer_amount, qr_amount, check_amount
  - driver_collected_amount, credit_amount, total_to_render
  - cash_bob_breakdown (JSONB con cortes), deposit_vouchers (JSONB)
  - 4 Firmas: Chofer, Supervisor, Cajero, Administrador
  - status = 'LIQUIDATED'
end note
CollClosingDB --> Service: savedClosingId

Service -> PaymentsDB: 5. updatePaymentReferencesStatus(525420010, 'CONCILIATED_IN_CASHIER')
PaymentsDB --> Service: ok

Service -> OrdersDB: 6. updateOrderStatus(525420010, 'LIQUIDATED')
OrdersDB --> Service: ok

Service -> HistoryDB: 7. insertOrderHistory(525420010, 'LIQUIDATED', 'Liquidación financiera de caja y arqueo conforme')
HistoryDB --> Service: ok

Service -> TX: 8. commitTransaction()
deactivate TX

Service --> Gateway: 201 Created (CollectionClosingResponse)
Gateway --> App: 201 Created JSON { closingId, status: 'LIQUIDATED', transportOrderId: 525420010 }
App --> User: Notificación de éxito: Cierre Financiero Cuadrado y Acta Oficial Lista
@enduml
